#: emailpage.cpp:123
msgid "Adjust image properties"
msgstr "Axustar propiedaes d'imaxe"

#: emailpage.cpp:125
msgid ""
"If you enable this option, all images to be sent can be resized and "
"recompressed."
msgstr ""
"Si actives esta opción, toles imáxenes que se manden podrán redimensionase y "
"recomprimise."

#: emailpage.cpp:128
msgid "Image Properties"
msgstr "Propiedaes d'imaxe"

#: emailpage.cpp:132 emailpage.cpp:150
msgid "Very Small (320 pixels)"
msgstr "Mui Pequeñu (320 pixels)"

#: emailpage.cpp:133 emailpage.cpp:151
